  "request": "docs/lab_requests.md Q011 (Wesley 9 Nov via the thesis chat): the 4.3 joins of chunk 8b re-flown on the 0.86 kg M2A ring, LAND 30 s after the weld",
  "changes_vs_R4094_R4107": "per config: the ring (plate worlds sq_/three_rigid_ground_rig_attach_pickup_L100_plate.sdf from tools/make_m2a_plate_world.py; his geometry rig_twin_L100_plate; the planner attach_radius 0.225, attach_z 0.02, payload_rest_z 0.02, load_mass 0.86, inertia untyped as on every 0.86 kg claim), QUAD4 weld point attach_y_offset 0.225 / weld_point_z 0.032, LAND at t 50 (30 s after the weld) instead of t 30. Code tree: code hash 5f527e4a631f (diff_sha256 1e3b555824a0) vs 5e7b1d3bd133: adds QUAD4s tracker drop-rule fix (its tracker_3 reads drop_on_loss true, was false; no drop requested in any run), his geometry entry, the plate worlds, tools.",
  "scorer": "tools/attach_clearance.py (takeoff to weld, tries, clearance), tools/s_metrics.score (validity), tools/m1_metrics.tb14 (landing), fold_in / landing / hold computed in the lab chats scratchpad score_q011.py from run.csv as x11_joins_2026-11-07.json",
  "fold_in_windows": "peak_abs_deg: WELD to min(LAND, WELD + 15 s) = WELD + 15 s here (LAND at +30 s); peak_abs_deg_10s: WELD to WELD + 10 s, the window R4094-R4107 had because they landed at +10 s. Same values in every run here.",
  "hold_tensions": "the figure scripts measured tension (docs/figures/review_2026-11-05/fig_join_sim.py: 0.55 kg x |fed-forward cable acceleration|, 0.2 s smoothing) over LAND - 20.5 s to LAND - 0.5 s",
  "figure_run": "R4227 replaces R4106 (fri30_sq6b, layout (d)): its four tensions are the steadier of the pair over the 20 s before LAND (sd 0.008-0.039 N, drift <= 0.07 N; R4226 sd 0.03-0.10 N, drift up to 0.18 N), no late planner tick (R4226 0.108 %), fold-in peak 1.62 vs 1.68 deg"
 },
